#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Sampler's core task is sampling the output register from the execution "
"of one or more quantum circuits. [Dynamic circuits](/guides/execute-dynamic-"
"circuits) and parameterized circuits are accepted as input (if parametrized "
"circuits are submitted, the parameter values must also be provided). Sampler"
" also supports built-in dynamical decoupling and twirling for [error "
"suppression](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques).\n"
msgstr ""
"Tugas teras Sampler adalah pensampelan daftar output daripada pelaksanaan "
"satu atau lebih Circuit kuantum. [Circuit dinamik](/guides/execute-dynamic-"
"circuits) dan Circuit berparameter diterima sebagai input (jika Circuit "
"berparameter dihantar, nilai parameter juga mesti disediakan). Sampler juga "
"menyokong dynamical decoupling dan twirling terbina dalam untuk [penindasan "
"ralat](/guides/error-mitigation-and-suppression-techniques).\n"

