#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Steps to use the Sampler primitive {#steps-to-use-the-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah-langkah untuk menggunakan primitif Sampler {#steps-to-use-the-"
"sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. Mulakan akaun {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because Qiskit Runtime is a managed service, you first need to initialize "
"your account. You can then select the QPU you want to use to calculate the "
"expectation value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kerana Qiskit Runtime adalah perkhidmatan terurus, anda perlu memulakan "
"akaun anda terlebih dahulu. Anda kemudian boleh memilih QPU yang ingin anda "
"gunakan untuk mengira nilai jangkaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in the [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup)"
" topic if you don't already have an account set up.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ikuti langkah-langkah dalam topik [Sediakan akaun IBM Cloud "
"anda](/guides/cloud-setup) jika anda belum menyediakan akaun.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"gate pecahan\">\n"

