" `use_fractional_gates=True` when requesting a backend from a "
"`QiskitRuntimeService` instance. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk menggunakan [gate pecahan](/guides/fractional-gates) yang baru "
"disokong, tetapkan `use_fractional_gates=True` apabila meminta Backend dari "
"instans `QiskitRuntimeService`. Contohnya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This is an experimental feature and might change in the future.\n"
msgstr "Ini adalah ciri eksperimen dan mungkin berubah pada masa depan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
